{
  "video_id": "kEoFVaHsy_U",
  "language_code": "en",
  "is_generated": true,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "See, Liz? I told you I'd find it.",
      "start": 9.0,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So, can we get dinner now?",
      "start": 11.72,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Seems the villagers were right. This",
      "start": 13.64,
      "duration": 7.52
    },
    {
      "text": "creature is clearly not of this world.",
      "start": 15.68,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Can you understand me?",
      "start": 21.96,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": ">> It says it's hungry.",
      "start": 28.6,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": ">> How can you tell?",
      "start": 30.52,
      "duration": 2.84
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Because I'm hearing the same noises from",
      "start": 31.96,
      "duration": 2.96
    },
    {
      "text": "my stomach.",
      "start": 33.36,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Please take this seriously.",
      "start": 34.92,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Still, this looks like the beast the",
      "start": 36.84,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "locals told me about.",
      "start": 38.6,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Now, I know the shot's blurry, but",
      "start": 41.28,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "that's the best we got. No one's wanted",
      "start": 43.56,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "to get close to whatever that is.",
      "start": 46.16,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": ">> That was smart. Is there anything that",
      "start": 48.84,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "you can tell me about this creature?",
      "start": 50.84,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Well, when it first showed up, our",
      "start": 52.68,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "animals started disappearing.",
      "start": 55.24,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Soon after, even the game in the woods",
      "start": 57.76,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "was gone. Now, no one wants to leave",
      "start": 60.36,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "their house. The people here ain't",
      "start": 63.08,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "easily scared. If this was something",
      "start": 65.36,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "normal, we'd deal with it ourselves, but",
      "start": 68.12,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "it's pretty obvious it ain't.",
      "start": 71.04,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Of course. Don't worry.",
      "start": 72.76,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "This is exactly the sort of assignment",
      "start": 75.32,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "we're here for.",
      "start": 77.44,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "If you can understand me,",
      "start": 78.88,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "you can't stay near a village where",
      "start": 81.2,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "there are people you can hurt.",
      "start": 82.88,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Apologies, but we'll have to relocate",
      "start": 84.96,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "you to an enclosed area until I'm able",
      "start": 88.04,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "to find a way to return you to where you",
      "start": 90.64,
      "duration": 2.64
    },
    {
      "text": "came.",
      "start": 92.36,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Oh, so we're capturing it? Okay, I'll",
      "start": 93.28,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "tire it out, then you capture it, then",
      "start": 96.32,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "you'll buy me dinner. GG rates.",
      "start": 98.68,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Come on, [snorts] chase me.",
      "start": 103.16,
      "duration": 3.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Huh?",
      "start": 110.36,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": ">> It can cast magic?",
      "start": 111.6,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": ">> NO, THERE!",
      "start": 117.28,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": ">> WHAT?",
      "start": 119.04,
      "duration": 3.446
    },
    {
      "text": ">> LIZ!",
      "start": 121.16,
      "duration": 3.346
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [screaming]",
      "start": 122.486,
      "duration": 2.02
    },
    {
      "text": ">> SHIORI.",
      "start": 129.32,
      "duration": 2.52
    },
    {
      "text": "WHAT?",
      "start": 133.76,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "What did you do to her?",
      "start": 135.4,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "On a chance that you can understand me,",
      "start": 139.24,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll tell you this. If you don't return",
      "start": 141.52,
      "duration": 7.2
    },
    {
      "text": "my friend now, you'll regret it.",
      "start": 144.0,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "So be it.",
      "start": 150.08,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Shiori, come on. We're supposed to go",
      "start": 166.68,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "out today.",
      "start": 170.08,
      "duration": 2.56
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Uh-huh.",
      "start": 171.4,
      "duration": 4.559
    },
    {
      "text": ">> What if we go to the movies? That sounds",
      "start": 172.64,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "like fun, right?",
      "start": 175.959,
      "duration": 2.361
    },
    {
      "text": ">> It looks fine.",
      "start": 177.04,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Ugh, you're not even listening.",
      "start": 178.32,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Yep. Sure.",
      "start": 180.4,
      "duration": 3.04
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Shiori.",
      "start": 182.08,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "I was hoping to talk to you about this",
      "start": 183.44,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "after a fun day out, but I really need",
      "start": 185.44,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "to ask you.",
      "start": 188.2,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you still [music] think about what",
      "start": 190.04,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "life was like before the cell?",
      "start": 191.36,
      "duration": 4.159
    },
    {
      "text": "Because I",
      "start": 194.08,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Liz! Tell Shiori.",
      "start": 195.519,
      "duration": 5.801
    },
    {
      "text": "Is something wrong?",
      "start": 200.0,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I've come to seek your help, Archiver.",
      "start": 201.32,
      "duration": 6.68
    },
    {
      "text": ">> What? But I'm busy.",
      "start": 203.76,
      "duration": 6.4
    },
    {
      "text": ">> While on a mission for justice, I",
      "start": 208.0,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "encountered a dark and magical beast.",
      "start": 210.16,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "The locals said that since its arrival,",
      "start": 212.6,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "all the animal life has all but",
      "start": 214.8,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "completely vanished.",
      "start": 216.12,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "It can create a black ink to snatch its",
      "start": 218.44,
      "duration": 5.519
    },
    {
      "text": "prey, and it may have telekinetic",
      "start": 221.32,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "abilities.",
      "start": 223.959,
      "duration": 3.481
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Sounds like a mindless void.",
      "start": 225.16,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": ">> A what?",
      "start": 227.44,
      "duration": 2.519
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Oh, I read about those in one of",
      "start": 228.32,
      "duration": 3.199
    },
    {
      "text": "Shiori's books.",
      "start": 229.959,
      "duration": 2.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Um,",
      "start": 231.519,
      "duration": 3.601
    },
    {
      "text": "if I'm remembering it right, they grow",
      "start": 232.239,
      "duration": 4.361
    },
    {
      "text": "in strength and knowledge by pulling",
      "start": 235.12,
      "duration": 2.8
    },
    {
      "text": "living things into their pocket",
      "start": 236.6,
      "duration": 2.08
    },
    {
      "text": "dimension.",
      "start": 237.92,
      "duration": 2.56
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Pocket dimension?",
      "start": 238.68,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you mean that what it claims isn't",
      "start": 240.48,
      "duration": 2.44
    },
    {
      "text": "lost?",
      "start": 241.92,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Um, not right away.",
      "start": 242.92,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Once it's captured in enough life force,",
      "start": 245.68,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "it'll become a powerful demon by",
      "start": 247.56,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "absorbing everything in the pocket",
      "start": 249.12,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "dimension. And once that happens, well,",
      "start": 251.12,
      "duration": 7.44
    },
    {
      "text": "anything in there will be gone forever.",
      "start": 255.0,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": ">> I see.",
      "start": 258.56,
      "duration": 3.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Then this beast needs to be stopped at",
      "start": 260.0,
      "duration": 2.68
    },
    {
      "text": "once.",
      "start": 261.64,
      "duration": 2.36
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Sorry.",
      "start": 262.68,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "If my horn wasn't broken, I could, but",
      "start": 264.0,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "nowadays",
      "start": 266.76,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": ">> It's fine. Let's can do it. I believe in",
      "start": 268.08,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "her.",
      "start": 271.68,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me know how it goes.",
      "start": 273.44,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Shiori, I'll require your help to defeat",
      "start": 275.04,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": "this creature.",
      "start": 277.6,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Not now. I'm busy. Come back tomorrow.",
      "start": 278.52,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": ">> But Shiori, if I'm remembering what I",
      "start": 281.4,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "read right, doesn't that monster's power",
      "start": 283.8,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "grow exponentially? [music]",
      "start": 285.96,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": ">> If that is so, then tomorrow may be too",
      "start": 287.88,
      "duration": 2.84
    },
    {
      "text": "late.",
      "start": 290.12,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Nah, you'll be fine. You're the leader",
      "start": 290.72,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "of Justice, after all.",
      "start": 293.72,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Be realistic. What if",
      "start": 295.36,
      "duration": 6.559
    },
    {
      "text": ">> No what ifs. Just do your best.",
      "start": 297.6,
      "duration": 4.319
    },
    {
      "text": ">> The people could",
      "start": 304.24,
      "duration": 2.6
    },
    {
      "text": ">> There, there. We'll be okay.",
      "start": 304.919,
      "duration": 3.241
    },
    {
      "text": ">> You can't possibly",
      "start": 306.84,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Go, go. Less chatting, more fighting.",
      "start": 308.16,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Please listen.",
      "start": 311.0,
      "duration": 3.04
    },
    {
      "text": "It",
      "start": 317.56,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "It took GG.",
      "start": 319.4,
      "duration": 3.04
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Ugh.",
      "start": 324.2,
      "duration": 1.68
    },
    {
      "text": ">> What?",
      "start": 325.32,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": ">> If it ate GG, then it knows about my",
      "start": 325.88,
      "duration": 6.6
    },
    {
      "text": "existence.",
      "start": 329.52,
      "duration": 2.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Ugh.",
      "start": 334.84,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "And it's Hail Mary.",
      "start": 335.88,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Ew. Gross. Shut up.",
      "start": 346.04,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": ">> You can understand it?",
      "start": 348.92,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": ">> You can't?",
      "start": 350.4,
      "duration": 2.92
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [screaming]",
      "start": 357.634,
      "duration": 2.02
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Liz, you need to keep your distance.",
      "start": 363.04,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [screaming]",
      "start": 379.904,
      "duration": 2.02
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Shiori, Liz!",
      "start": 382.52,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Risa, run.",
      "start": 384.36,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [panting]",
      "start": 391.039,
      "duration": 2.02
    }
  ]
}
